{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105261","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105261/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105261/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105261/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105261","id":2987334200,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6yDxo4","number":105261,"title":"Godot 4.4.stable NoiseTexture2D cannot return an image with get_image() on ready","user":{"login":"kitbear444","id":161773838,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaR5Dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161773838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbear444","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-04-11T01:41:48Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:13:12Z","closed_at":"2025-04-12T00:42:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4 stable, 4.2.1 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.2.1.stable/Godot v4.4.stable - Windows 10.0.26100 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n`NoiseTexture2D` doesn't return an image object from `get_image()` during `_ready()` the first time the Node is created. If you `await texture.changed` before the first call, `get_image()` will return an Image properly. However, this workaround isn't ideal, since if the Node is created again beyond this first time, the `changed` signal won't be called again due to the `NoiseTexture2D` being instantiated already.\n\nCode Example:\n```gdscript\n# Called when the node enters the scene tree for the first time.\nfunc _ready():\n\tprint(texture.get_image())\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/520378a1-2693-4947-9695-d35f8f675403)\n\nThis seems to be the same issue as #60333, just with a different Texture2D type.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a TextureRect\n2. Assign a NoiseTexture2D to the texture\n3. Add the line `print(texture.get_image())` to the _ready function\n4. Run the project\n5. Output will show `<Object#null>`\n6. Add `await texture.changed` above the print\n7. Output will now show the `Image`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[NoiseTexture2D MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19697660/NoiseTexture2D.MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"kitbear444","id":161773838,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaR5Dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161773838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbear444","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbear444/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105261/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105261/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}